variable C25 equal 0.5*(174911.462789191+${C2pos})
variable C25 equal 0.5*(174911.462789191+-174911.464797334)
variable C3${dir} equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C35 equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C35 equal 0.5*(171628.007025166+${C3pos})
variable C35 equal 0.5*(171628.007025166+-171628.038992699)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C45 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
